"_O_V_E_R_V_I_E_W.txt" Commented List of all files for Http, with one line descriptions.
"build.xml" Complex ANT build script for Http
"Chase.class" compiled Java byte code
"Chase.java" Chase redirection links to find new perm URL
"desc.btm" creates TCC file descriptions for project files
"descother.btm" creates TCC file descriptions for non-project files
"DESCRIPT.ION" TCC file descriptions
"descript0.ion" generated file of overriding descriptions to merge into DESCRIPT.ION
"descript2.ion" generated file default descriptions to merge into DESCRIPT.ION
"Fetch.class" compiled Java byte code
"Fetch.java" Fetch HTTP or HTTPS
"forzip.xml" list of extra files for ANT include in http32.zip
"Get.class" compiled Java byte code
"Get.java" Fetch a page from a website with HTTP GET
"grab.btm" copy in Java source code from IntelliJ and build it. Roedy's use only.
"Head.class" compiled Java byte code
"Head.java" HTTP HEAD to test if url exists
"Http.class" Http main Java program compiled byte code
"http.icon128.png" roughly 128x128 icon for the Http project
"http.icon16.png" 16x16 icon for the Http project
"http.icon32.png" 32x32 icon for the Http project
"http.icon48.png" roughly 48x48 icon for the Http project
"http.icon64.png" roughly 64x64 icon for the Http project
"http.jar" jarred class files: HTTP library to do GET/POST/HEAD/PROBE/CHASE
"Http.java" main Java program source
"http.look" uncommented jar manifest
"http.screenshot.png" screenshot for the Http project
"http.use" precis(summary) HTTP library to do GET/POST/HEAD/PROBE/CHASE Generated
"http.xml" ASP PAD desc of the Http project: HTTP library to do GET/POST/HEAD/PROBE/CHASE
"http32.zip" Http 3.2 distribute zip: HTTP library to do GET/POST/HEAD/PROBE/CHASE
"j18.txt" marker to indicate that Java compiler target version 1.8 needed.
"jdisplay.css" cascading style sheet for displaying source code in HTML
"MasterDistribution.site" URL to find the master copy of the Http project files
"mindprod.css" cascading style sheet for general HTML
"Post.class" compiled Java byte code
"Post.java" Fetch a page from a website with HTTP POST
"Probe.class" compiled Java byte code
"Probe.java" Test if a URL exists
"Read.class" compiled Java byte code
"Read.java" aux methods for reading from a website
"rebuild.xml" Simplified ANT build script for Http
"untouch.digest" generated: enables untouching (set date back) unchanged but redated files.
"use.txt" key facts about the Http project. Generates http.use
"version.txt" key current version info about the Http project. Generates http.use
"versionhistory.txt" complete version history of the Http project. Generates http.use
"zip.look" uncommented zip manifest for http32.zip
